id: QUAL-041
title: Avoid setInterval without cleanup (memory leak risk)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .tsx .jsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/
patterns:
  - regex: setInterval\s*\(
    message: "setInterval() — ensure corresponding clearInterval() exists. Uncleaned intervals cause memory leaks."
fix: Store the interval ID and call clearInterval() in cleanup (componentWillUnmount, useEffect return, or beforeDestroy).